.Dd May 17, 2026
.Dt NEWAQEMU 1
.Os Linux
.Sh NAME
.Nm newaqemu
.Nd QEMU virtual machine manager for modern Linux
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm newaqemu
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a graphical frontend for QEMU. It manages VM configuration files, launches
ordinary VMs via QEMU, and supports a libvirt-based GPU passthrough profile
(IOMMU, Intel iGPU SR-IOV VF, vfio-pci, Looking Glass / kvmfr).
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.It Fl -version
Show version.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa ~/.config/newaqemu/newaqemu.conf
Application settings.
.It Pa ~/.aqemu/
Legacy VM storage (still supported).
.It Pa /usr/share/newaqemu/
Installed icons, templates, and translations.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr qemu 1 ,
.Xr virsh 1 ,
.Xr looking-glass-client 1 ,
.Lk https://pen.waltuh.cyou/yonle/iommu-with-sr-iov-gpu-accelerated-windows-vm-on-a-linux-laptop-that-has-only
.Sh AUTHORS
newaqemu — fork of AQEMU for modern Linux (James Ed Randson and contributors).
